Elizabeth,

Ahead of the 10:00 review, I have attached my response to your comments, mapp=
ed to the revised implementation case. Could we check in particular that slid=
e 3 leaves the first 12 months unquantified, and that slides 4 and 5 keep the=
 one-off cost separate from the timing of the planned effect?

I will bring a PDF copy of the slides to the meeting room for you to write on=
. The decision I am seeking today is whether the corrected explanation is sui=
table to discuss with Kenneth; a customer decision to start remains separate.

Best,
Nicholas

